---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/trifusion-logo.png" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Trifusion developer — The Dou and their special friends</title>
		<meta name="description" content="A developer team in Victorias City creating responsive, user-friendly websites with thoughtful design and dependable code." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
